/v1/","context":{"app_id":4253020,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1846018067927019","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute is coming out 20th January 2027","summary":"Hey nerds, we have a big announcement.We're hyped to announce that Murder Meet Cute will be releasing on January 20th 2027.We're stoked to finally announce the date, and that the game will be with you soon. Check out the new release date reveal trailer below:The support for Murder Meet Cute has blow us away - as a small team of 3 working on this as a labour of love, we've come a lot further than we ever thought we would.If you haven’t already, you can play the Murder Meet Cute demo ahead of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T18:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1845383656383423","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest 🤝 Murder Meet Cute 🤝 Horror Game Awards","summary":"Hey nerds, we’ve got a big month in coming and we have tasks for YOU! Yeah that’s right, time to get off your butts and show us what you’re made of. As a team of 3, and no budget, this game has been a real labor of love that we’re excited to share; but getting the word out there has been extremely difficult. That’s why we’re calling on all of you to help us spread the word. We have 4 upcoming events to get involved with. Harvest of Terror: A Horror Game Awards Showcase We participated in this sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:09:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1842212951310350","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute has been selected for the Prismatic Indies showcase","summary":"Murder Meet Cute has been selected for the Prismatic Indie showcase. This showcase is especially for developers of small teams, who are making their game without publishing support. That's us!Catch the festival from the 7th -11th September here on steam. What's next?After a quiet summer, we've been ramping up development of Murder Meet Cute, and we're excited to bring you some juicy updates come October. Look out for a new trailer that will finally reveal the launch date of the game.Another exci","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:17:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1840310314341268","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"We're going to Otakuthon & AdventureX!","summary":"So it took a few weeks to recover, but we're back from Develop Brighton, and it was a blast. 100s of players descended on Brilliant Indie Treasures and from what we could tell, had a blast trying out Murder Meet CuteDon't worry if you didn't get a chance to try out the demo, we have a few more locations we're gonna be at before the years out.This August 7th, we'll be at Otakuthon in Montreal. It'll just be the demo, but come by and check it out. At the end of August (26th-28th) We'll be in Colog","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T09:06:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1837955055363989","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute Demo out now!","summary":"We're happy to announce the hotly awaited demo for Murder Meet Cute has finally dropped, and it’s dripping with snark, puns and 90s nostalgia. Starting Monday July 13th, you'll be able to play a shortened version of the first day of the game. Chat with your friends on Jabber, talk shit on the conspiracy forum, wrangle customers in your not so polite service voice, and sleuth their machines to find out their secrets... and maybe just uncover a murder mystery...Add the demo to your library and sta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T17:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055363989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1836506165560888","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute has been selected for the Brilliant Indie Treasures showcase","summary":"Murder Meet Cute has been selected for the Brilliant Indie Treasures showcase at Develop Conference BrightonWe'll be showcasing our game this July 15th 2026, alongside other shining indie teams. If you'd like to meet one of the devs behind the game, we'll see you there.Here's more info on the event.In the meantime, said demo is getting fixed up just in time to be ready for you folks. That's right, week of July 13th, expect to be able to finally play a demo of Murder Meet Cute. More info on that ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T19:53:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1834602721202596","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute Content Creator Demo","summary":"We keep threatening you all with a demo, but we tricked you! And instead sent it out to content creators. What you gonna do, cry about it. >=]But seriously, we've sent out this early version of the demo to spy in on streamers like TangoMushi and Thegamingmetalhead to see their reception of it. Needless to say, they've been having a great time, as have we!LanceandGIn laughing as they act out the characters conversations in the shop.You can head on over to Twitch and catch some of the streamers tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T17:22:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721202596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1833968530887458","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute to be feature in Horror Game Awards Midsummer Night's Scream","summary":"That's right, Murder Meet Cute will be featured alongside other horror themed titles in the Horror Game Awards summer showcase this June 1st at 7pm BST. You can watch the entire showcase over on their channel.Not interested in the entire showcase? Watch the new trailer here once it's live at the same time.n the meantime, we're going to be at Twitchcon Rotterdam this weekend, so be sure to come say hi if you see our art wearing trooper. You can watch her destroy our art directors lovely art in re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T08:37:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887458","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1832700592789089","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"We need YOU to be part of Murder Meet Cute","summary":"As part of Amys investigation into the local serial killer, she happens across other clients private files. As part of this, we've amassed real 90s photos from friends and family, but we could use a whole lot more!If you have any authentic 90s (or 80s) photos that you'd like to share, please use the form below to potentially be included as part of the game. https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdyc3N98IV7ktDrvpaxGqkSI6v-vhkHcwTfUMFEK2Fwz7I6BQ/viewformIn the meantime, we're still working hard","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T13:34:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1830797770233507","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute will now launch in Brazilian Portuguese and Russian","summary":"What's up nerds, more good news, Murder Meet Cute will now be coming to you in 5 languages on launch. These include:EnglishFrenchSimplified ChineseBrazilian PortugueseRussianThis is possible due to the amazing work of Thiago Mania for Brazilian Portuguese, Ratmir Salimov for Russian and Warlocs for SImplified Chinese. French is being done in house!Don't forget that InterfaceX26 starts on Monday 27th, a steam festival that runs for a week featuring over 150 interface games. Murder Meet Cute has b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T15:35:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770233507","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1829528821318517","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Murder Meet Cute is an InterfaceX26 official selection title","summary":"We're gonna be part of InterfaceX26, check it out 27th April to 4th May: https://interfacex.net/150+ Worldwide interface devs are also tryna make a new tag for interface games. Help us all out by tagging them: https://interfacex.net/tag/Keep an eye out for the showcase May 2nd, you might just find your favorite goth chick in amongst the main features, presented by Lucy and Kurt from Gamespot.Whats next for Murder Meet Cute?We've got more announcements later this week on some extra features in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T17:17:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821318517","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253020-1826992588601559","game_id":"steam-4253020","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome? Pfffft.","summary":"Hey losers, so you’re here for Murder Meet Cute. That’s cool, I guess. But don’t get comfortable, I’m not your babysitter. I’ll see you soon, when there’s a demo. Until then, you better wishlist, or there’ll be consequences.But I couldn’t care less.Chronicallyheartless","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-16T13:56:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588601559","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4253020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:50:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:50:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4253020":"2026-10-26T01:50:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":